  "description": "An LLM + Model Context Protocol pipeline that incrementally ports legacy Fortran 90 HPC kernels to GPU (OpenACC) + Cython (Phase 1) and to differentiable JAX (Phase 2). Built on the ECMWF Loki AST framework; calls any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Mistral La Plateforme by default; self-hosted vLLM/TGI/Ollama for full sovereignty). Bundles a documentation-only mode, a Loki-only static analyzer for CI, and a per-stage Mistral model selector (Codestral for code-gen, Mistral-Large for reasoning).",

